      "description": "Somewhere beyond Neptune, at the edge of our Solar System, there may be a world we have never seen.\n\nFor years, scientists have searched for Planet Nine — a hypothetical planet hidden deep in the darkness, its existence suggested only by the strange gravitational behavior of distant objects. \n\nBut what if we finally found it?\n\nIn the future, humanity launches its first mission into the unexplored outer Solar System.\nAfter years of traveling through the darkness, the crew finally reaches the coordinates of Planet 9.\n\nWhat they discover there was never supposed to exist.\n\nAll credit to:\n\nLast Sumerian\n@Meysamderees",
